      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds pretty convincing. i'm worried though, if the foundation asks about the counter-arguments from traditional conservationists, how should i frame them so they don't undermine our rewilding pitch? like, how can i show their views are basically just based on old-school thinking?",
